      "message": "Dropping and recreating `starlark_session_` here (and in `SetBuildDir()` at line 90) would cause use-after-free if anything already obtained a reference via `starlark_session()` (Rust FFI treats it as `\u0026\u0027static Session`).\n\nIf `SetRootPath()` / `SetBuildDir()` are only expected to be called during setup before `starlark_session()` is first accessed, `DCHECK(!starlark_session_.load(std::memory_order_relaxed))` would be safer than silently dropping an active session. (If resetting an already-initialized session is actually needed in tests, could we document that precondition?)",
